{
  "version": "2.17",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "y2xNdf",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Brief · Ajustes",
      "width": 360,
      "fill": "$bg-muted",
      "cornerRadius": "$radius-md",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": "$space-4",
      "padding": "$space-5",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "X8ZiJF",
          "name": "BT",
          "fill": "$fg-default",
          "content": "Ajustes — brief",
          "fontFamily": "$font-display",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O572gY",
          "name": "BB",
          "fill": "$fg-subtle",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "PURPOSE\nOne Ajustes for a single-user instance (D5): the person who owns the account also owns the box, so /profile and the /admin zone are one hub with sections — cuenta, apariencia y región, avisos, tu instancia, tus datos.\n\nENTRY POINTS\nThe fifth BottomNav tab (/settings). Its rows open /settings/account, /settings/password, TOTP enrolment (auth.pen), /admin/integrations, /admin/logs, /admin/settings, Mission Control at /admin/jobs, /admin/errors (only with developer_mode, ADR-020) and the importer (assets.pen). En mantenimiento is what a visitor who is not signed in gets from any page while maintenance_mode is on.\n\nSCREENS (LEFT → RIGHT)\nHub · Nombre y correo · Contraseña · Integraciones · Integraciones · Administrar (one source opened) · Integraciones · Estados (the four states) · Registros · Registros · Detalle (one entry opened) · Estado y mantenimiento · Errores · Errores · Detalle · En mantenimiento.\nNo desktop artboards: every screen here is one column (max-w-3xl, or max-w-xl for the two forms) inside the shell (D4).\n\nBUSINESS RULES\n• The theme applies on select and the currency PATCHes on select; nothing waits for a Guardar (D58).\n• Avisos: the bell cannot be turned off (D16); the phone switch renders only where VAPID keys exist.\n• Integraciones lists every registered source, the ones not connected first. Each card says its role, its own quota in its own unit, and whose problem a non-working source is: sin API key (your instance), sin cuota (your quota), bloqueada (the provider). One API key per source (ADR-015).\n• Deleting a source removes it from the list; it comes back only with bin/rails stockerly:sync.\n• Estado: each switch is its own PATCH and every flip is kept in SiteConfigChange. Maintenance shows the 503 page to anyone not signed in; the owner keeps working, and login stays reachable.\n• Tus datos: Borrar movimientos keeps the account; Borrar cuenta returns the instance to the setup wizard.\n\nCOPY SOURCE\nconfig/locales/es-MX.yml — settings.*, admin.integrations.*, admin.logs.*, admin.settings.*, admin.errors.*, mantenimiento.*. Provider descriptions and what a missing key costs: MarketData::Domain::ProviderDirectory. Manual sync names: DataSourceRegistry. Log messages: whatever each job wrote to SystemLog.\n\nSTATES NOT DRAWN\n• Hub · Seguridad active: \"Activa · te quedan %{count} códigos de recuperación\".\n• Hub without developer_mode: no Errores row. Without VAPID keys: no phone switch.\n• Integraciones empty (every source deleted): \"No hay fuentes configuradas\" with \"Vuelven al correr bin/rails stockerly:sync en tu servidor.\"\n• Registros and Errores empty or filtered to nothing: one dashed card reading \"Tu instancia no ha registrado nada todavía.\" / \"Tu instancia no ha registrado ningún error.\" or \"Nada con esos filtros.\" with Limpiar filtros.\n• Estado with maintenance on: a warning box under the switches, \"Quien no haya iniciado sesión ve la página de mantenimiento. Tu sesión sigue viva.\"\n• Estado with no recorded change: \"Todavía no hay cambios registrados.\"\n• Tus datos with nothing to delete: Borrar movimientos disabled.\n• Any screen on desktop: the same column inside the SidebarNav shell.\n\nOPEN FINDINGS\nNone with a D number.\n\nHISTORY\n→ Log · Ajustes",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
